## Common Patterns

### Recording Activity

```swift
// Every 2 seconds:
1. Get active app (NSWorkspace)
2. Check idle time (CGEventSource)
3. If idle < 30s → record heartbeat
4. Count keystrokes (if typing detected)
5. Save to database
6. Aggregate into 5-min blocks
```

### Time Block Rounding

```swift
// Round to 5-min boundary
let blockStart = floor(timestamp / 300) * 300
// 14:03:42 → 14:00:00
// 14:07:19 → 14:05:00
```

